re were experts in handling cold, harsh conditions. It would have been remarkable to have seen the level of planning required to handle a North-American winter in the 1800s. Their resourcefulness had been allowing them to thrive in this environment for centuries.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le11ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "33050", "text": "Two agitated men on horseback suddenly appeared on the track leading to the longhouse. They were met by an elderly man who extended his hand in trust and friendship.  One was the sheriff and the other was the man who had bought the title of the land beneath them. The sheriff claimed that they have arrested those who had disagreed with documents such as these in the past. Their faces showed fear and disdain for their company.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le11ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "56060", "text": "One of the trespassers then produced a paper, signed by the Governor. \u201cAccording to the laws of this state, I am now the owner of these lands and everything they contain,\u201d he proclaimed. With that, they proceeded by removing all the contents of the huts including bedding, chairs and stoves. Eyes downcast, the old man stood in silence, watching his world crumble to his feet.  The unwanted intruders then began to sprinkle oil throughout the settlement and set a match to it.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le11ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "81900", "text": "Within half an hour, thick  smoke could be seen for miles. Tribe members came running from all directions, desperate to extinguish the blaze. It was a hopeless position. By nightfall, the glowing embers  dotted the horizon and the wails of a culture could be heard in the darkness. This callous act is said to have marked the end of Sauk settlement in the area.", "id": 4, "image": "engenn11le11ob08re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le11ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le11ob08re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": ""}, {"time": "5000", "text": "A Narrative About The Past", "id": 1, "image": ""}, {"time": "7000", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">What do they include?</span>", "id": 2, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn11le11ob08re3vid01"}}], "id": 2, "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}